# Drain Power has Bot2 activate a mana ability of each land it controls (CR 117.2e). Bot2 starts Baxter Building's "{4}, {T}:
# Add four mana in any combination of colors", taps its Island while paying, and gives it up: the activation is reversed
# whole, the Island's included (CR 733.1), so the Island is untapped and still owed. Asked again, Bot2 may take the same
# ability (nothing it gave up is refused it) and pays the {4} with the Island and three Moxen this time: a mana ability of the
# Island was activated (CR 605.3a), so it is asked for nothing more. Bot1 adds the four mana Bot2 lost; the Moxen's paid the
# {4}, and Mox Pearl, no land, stays untapped.

